OL,3,GNEWSAFire service could cut engines to
OL,4,Asave money
OL,5,
OL,6,FFire engines could be removed as a fire
OL,7,Fservices faces a financial "cliff
OL,8,Fedge", councillors have warned.
OL,10,FCounty Durham and Darlington Fire and
OL,11,FRescue is looking at ways to balance
OL,12,Fits books amid falling government
OL,13,Ffunding, rising costs and uncertainty
OL,14,Fover its future finances.
OL,16,FAmong the savings previously put
OL,17,Fforward is the removal of a second fire
OL,18,Fengine from a station, which could save
OL,19,Fabout #1.34m.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
