OL,3,GNEWSAFire service could cut engines to
OL,4,Asave money
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking at a Durham County Council
OL,7,Fjoint scrutiny meeting on Thursday,
OL,8,Fcouncillor Richard Bell said the
OL,9,Ffinancial situation was "very
OL,10,Fconcerning" and warned difficult
OL,11,Fdecisions could lie ahead.
